      "comment": "Benben: Abdju Pit and King Deshret's ruins",
      "content": "Benben was found in the ruins of the Abdju Pit, part of King Deshret's ancient civilisation, which Tirzad's expedition had come to study. It was unusually non-hostile among the Primal Constructs there. It opened Khemenu Temple and the Mausoleum of King Deshret and showed the way inside Khaj-Nisut.",
