      "key": [
        "Energy Transformation Capacitors",
        "Aderfi"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Benben"
      ],
      "comment": "Benben: Benben's recharging",
      "content": "After leaving Khaj-Nisut, Benben's power failed and it lay still at the Tanit camps. Aderfi offered to fix it and arranged a trade with the Fatui for Energy Transformation Capacitors, in exchange for letting them study it. The deal never happened because Aderfi was killed for betraying the Tanit. The Traveler took the capacitors from a Fatui camp, and Benben absorbed their energy and recovered.",
