        "Benben"
      ],
      "comment": "Benben: Jeht and Benben",
      "content": "Jeht gave it its name because it floated like Paimon but lower, and treats it as a friend rather than a tool. Later content shows them together at Gurabad (6.6), where it helps her free the Traveler from a trap in the ruins. A researcher's note describes them as a mercenary band's leader and her strange contraption.",
